# Twenty-four integer vectors. `vmovdqu` is `vmovdqu32` under EVEX, the lane width in the name being a
# statement about masking; the arithmetic mixes the dword rows (W0) with a shift by an immediate, whose
# destination is `vvvv` rather than ModRM.reg - so a result in xmm20 is V' and not R'.
vectors24(%p: Ptr): i32x4 {
    {
        %l0 = load %p, 16: i32x4
        %o1 = add %p, 16L: Ptr
        %l1 = load %o1, 16: i32x4
